# FlexFat config golden-parity sentinel (Unit 1).
#
# Until the config generator is ported there is nothing to regenerate, so this
# diffs the committed golden artifact against itself: a trivially-green
# placeholder that proves the golden-diff harness runs under check-flexfat. When
# the generator lands, the left-hand side becomes the freshly generated file.
#
# RUN: diff %S/sentinel.golden %S/sentinel.golden
